[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163173122","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/168#issuecomment-163173122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/168","id":163173122,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MzE3MzEyMg==","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-03T18:31:24Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:10:08Z","body":"_Original comment by_ **Bengt Lüers (BitBucket: [Bengt](http://bitbucket.org/Bengt), GitHub: @Bengt?)**:\n\n---\n\nI just ran into this under Fedora 20. I used `-o png`, so that is affected, too. That stacktrace did not tell my anything; I could only fix pyreverse when installing graphviz as suggested here. I agree that a clearer message would be nice but wouldn't it be better to list graphviz as a dependency of pylint?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163173122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/163173124","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/168#issuecomment-163173124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/168","id":163173124,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2MzE3MzEyNA==","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-05T13:37:15Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:10:08Z","body":"_Original comment by_ **Emile Anclin (BitBucket: [anclin](http://bitbucket.org/anclin), GitHub: @anclin?)**:\n\n---\n\nI had following patch for **Pyreverse**:\n\n```\n#!diff\n# HG changeset patch\n# User \"Emile Anclin\"\n# Parent ce22d53fb374090baa0e1ca6ad5250b9131f5420\nPyreverse: Nice error msg when Graphviz is not installed. Closes #168\n\ndiff -r ce22d53fb374 pyreverse/main.py\n--- a/pyreverse/main.py Wed Apr 16 18:55:48 2014 +0200\n+++ b/pyreverse/main.py Wed Apr 23 17:24:30 2014 +0200\n@@ -95,6 +95,8 @@\n         self.manager = AstroidManager()\n         self.register_options_provider(self.manager)\n         args = self.load_command_line_configuration()\n+        if self.config.output_format not in ('dot', 'vcg'):\n+            check_graphviz_available(self.config)\n         sys.exit(self.run(args))\n\n     def run(self, args):\n@@ -120,5 +122,18 @@\n         return 0\n\n\n+def check_graphviz_available(config):\n+    \"\"\"check if we need graphviz for different output format\"\"\"\n+    from subprocess import call, PIPE\n+    try:\n+        call(['dot', '-V'], stdout=PIPE, stderr=PIPE)\n+    except OSError:\n+        print (\"The output format '%s' is currently not available.\\n\"\n+               \"Please install 'Graphviz' to have other output formats \"\n+               \"than 'dot' or 'vcg'.\" % config.output_format)\n+        sys.exit(32)\n+\n+\n if __name__ == '__main__':\n     Run(sys.argv[1:])\n+\n```\n\nbut now I think the patch should be more in _logilab.common.graph_ since it's actually it who depends on **Graphviz** (but I guess we don't want to make _lgc_ depend on anything)\n","auth